<title>ITALY: RALLYING-SAN REMO RALLY POSITIONS AFTER FIRST DAY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-SAN REMO RALLY POSITIONS AFTER FIRST DAY.</headline>
<dateline>ARREZZO, Italy 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions at the</p>
<p>end of the first day of the San Remo rally on Monday:</p>
<p> 1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza   1 hour 32 minutes 47</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p> 2. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza    4 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Andrea Dallavilla (Italy) Toyota Celica	    19</p>
<p> 4. Gilberto Pianezzola (Italy) Toyota Celica	  24</p>
<p> 5. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort Cosworth	  34</p>
<p> 6. Didier Auriol (France) Mitsubishi Lancer	   37</p>
<p> 7. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza	   38</p>
<p> 8. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth	 40</p>
<p> 9. Franco Cunico (Italy) Ford Escort Cosworth	 44</p>
<p> 10.  Angelo Medeghini (Italy) Subaru Impreza	1:23</p>
</text>
